ng" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="799" width="1354" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure></div></div></div><div class="StatisticsCarousel_swiperNav__ZNiR0"><div class="StatisticsCarousel_swiperNavNext__OgPJn swiper-panel-next"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="Timeline_timeline__KvsOC"><div class="container"><div class="Timeline_headings__PF6gg"><p class="Timeline_heading__JBlOu"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>Our growth marketing process.</span></span></p><p class="Timeline_subheading__IVqa_"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span>Growth marketing works best when it is consistent, focused and connected to the website underneath it. We look at where your digital presence is today, what your audience needs next and how your content, search visibility and website performance can work harder together.</span></span></p></div><div class="Timeline_scroller__D0iTE"><div class="StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm"><div class="Timeline_inner__J706Z"><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="422" width="422" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Visibility review</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">1 day</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">We start by reviewing how your website currently performs across search, AI visibility, content, technical health and user experience. This helps us understand where your brand is already showing up and where competitors are stealing the conversation.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>SEO review</span><span>AI &amp; GEO visibility checks</span><span>Content review</span><span>Technical health check</span><span>Competitor visibility review</span><span>Analytics review</span><span>Priority recommendations</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="422" width="422" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Growth strategy</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">1 day</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Next, we turn the findings into a focused plan. We identify the opportunities most likely to move the needle, from content improvements and AI search optimisation to technical fixes, blog planning and website enhancements.
</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Growth roadmap</span><span>SEO priorities</span><span>GEO recommendations</span><span>Content opportunities</span><span>Technical priorities</span><span>Measurement framework</span><span>Monthly activity plan</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="422" width="422" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Content &amp; copywriting</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">Ongoing</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Strong visibility needs strong content. We create website copy, landing page content and ongoing blog articles that help your audience understand what you do, why it matters and why your brand deserves to be found.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Website copywriting</span><span>Blog writing</span><span>SEO content planning</span><span>Content optimisation</span><span>Metadata</span><span>Internal linking</span><span>AI search considerations</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="422" width="422" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>AI &amp; GEO support package</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">Ongoing</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">AI search is changing how people discover, compare and choose brands. We help structure your content, strengthen your authority signals and improve the clarity of your website so LLMs and AI search platforms can better understand what you do.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Monthly SEO performance reviews</span><span>GEO recommendations</span><span>Structured content guidance</span><span>Entity &amp; authority signals</span><span>FAQ optimisation</span><span>Content refreshes</span><span>Search intent mapping</span><span>Ongoing visibility monitoring</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/timeline-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="422" width="422" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>SiteCare website support </span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">Ongoing</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Your website should keep improving after launch. Through our SiteCare package, we support the technical health, stability and performance of your site, while identifying opportunities to improve speed, usability and conversion over time.
